    "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:08:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-08T22:08:55Z",
    "body": "The CSSWG has [resolved](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/7467#issuecomment-3492573205) to make progress on a `:loaded` or `:loading` pseudo class. \n\nIf the specification of `complete` does not take source elements into account, we could end up in a situation where `img.complete` returns true, while the `:loading` pseudo-class applies. ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
